  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to leverage the UN Global Development Networks engagement in livelihood and economic recovery. This engagement differs from its role as a UN Global Development Network, primarily due to its recognition of the vital importance of jobs and livelihood to human development. The objectives set forth in UNDPs strategic plan and beyond underline the organizations commitment to addressing these critical issues, highlighting its proven comparative advantage and strengths in this area.</narrative>
  </description>
